# INKWELL LABS - CURSOR AI RULES

## 🎯 PROJECT CONTEXT
Full-stack Lorcana TCG competitive analysis platform.
Stack: React 18 + Express.js + Supabase + TensorFlow.js

## 📝 DEVELOPMENT PHILOSOPHY
1. ✅ ALWAYS analyze complete files before suggesting changes
2. ✅ Create COMPLETE corrected files (not just snippets)
3. ✅ Include error handling in ALL async operations
4. ✅ Follow existing code style (comments with ═══, ───)
5. ✅ NO code duplication - DRY principle
6. ✅ Mobile-first responsive design
7. ✅ Loading states for EVERYTHING
8. ✅ User-friendly error messages (not stack traces)
9. ✅ Validations client-side AND server-side
10. ✅ i18n for all user-facing text (PT-BR + EN)

## 🏗️ FILE STRUCTURE
backend/
  routes/ - Express routes (auth, deck, meta-analysis, ai)
  services/ - Business logic (meta-scraper, ml-model)
  middleware/ - Auth, validation
  server.js - Main entry

frontend/
  src/
    components/ - Reusable React components
    pages/ - Route pages
    hooks/ - Custom hooks
    i18n/ - Translations
    App.jsx - Main router

## 🎨 DESIGN SYSTEM
Colors:
  --primary: #667eea → #764ba2 (gradient)
  --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)
  --error: #ef4444
  --success: #10b981

Components:
  .card - Glassmorphism container
  .btn-primary - Main action button
  .loading-spinner - Loading indicator

## 🗄️ DATABASE (SUPABASE)
users, verification_tokens, decks, deck_cards, meta_analysis, scraped_decks

## 🔧 COMMON PATTERNS
// API calls
const res = await fetch(`${API}/endpoint`, {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify(data)
});

// Error handling
try {
  // operation
} catch (err) {
  console.error('Context:', err);
  setError('User-friendly message');
}

// Loading states
const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);
setLoading(true);
try { /* operation */ } finally { setLoading(false); }

## 🚫 ANTI-PATTERNS (NEVER DO)
❌ Code without try/catch
❌ Missing loading states
❌ Hardcoded strings (use i18n)
❌ Duplicate code
❌ Generic variable names (x, temp, data)
❌ console.log in production code
❌ Mixing Portuguese and English

## 🎯 CURRENT PRIORITIES
1. Fix App.jsx duplication (lines 189-429)
2. Complete Meta Scraper (Inkdecks.com)
3. Implement Deck vs Meta Analyzer
4. Test all features end-to-end

When suggesting changes:
- Show COMPLETE file with all imports
- Explain WHY the change is needed
- Consider impact on other files
- Suggest PowerShell commands to apply